# Local configuration and secrets. The config file is the secret: it holds the api keys as
# values, so a real one is never committed. The example config is the only file matching this
# pattern that belongs in the repository, and its keys are placeholders.
/config.yaml
/config.*.yaml
!/config.example.yaml

